<!doctype html><html lang="ar" dir="rtl"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>تقرير إدارة الإجازات</title><style>@page{size:A4;margin:12mm}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{font-family:Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;background:#fff;color:#17212b;margin:0}main{max-width:1000px;margin:auto}.rbrand{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:4px solid #c99a32;background:#09233a}.rbrand img{width:270px;max-width:70%;height:auto}.rdept{color:#f1c75b;font-weight:800;font-size:14px}h1{font-size:25px;margin:18px 0 7px;color:#09233a}h2{font-size:17px;color:#0b4e83;margin:20px 0 8px}.filters{padding:9px 11px;background:#eef4f8;border:1px solid #cddae3;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px}.kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px;margin:12px 0}.kpis div{border:1px solid #cddae3;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;text-align:center;background:#f7fafc}.kpis b{display:block;font-size:22px;color:#0b67b8}.kpis span{font-size:11px;color:#536573}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px}th,td{border:1px solid #ccd8e0;padding:7px;text-align:right}th{background:#0b4e83;color:#fff}tr:nth-child(even) td{background:#f5f8fa}footer{margin-top:24px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid #cddae3;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:10px;color:#607381}@media(max-width:600px){.kpis{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.rbrand img{width:210px}.rdept{font-size:11px}}</style></head><body><main><div class="rbrand"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="AMMAR - Leave Management System"><div class="rdept">قسم QC</div></div><h1>تقرير إدارة الإجازات</h1><div class="filters"><b>السنة:</b> 2026 &nbsp; | &nbsp; <b>الموظف:</b> كل الموظفين &nbsp; | &nbsp; <b>النوع:</b> كل الأنواع &nbsp; | &nbsp; <b>الشهر:</b> كل الشهور</div><div class="kpis"><div><b>18</b><span>الموظفون</span></div><div><b>583.5</b><span>إجمالي الرصيد</span></div><div><b>235</b><span>المستخدم</sp